      "category": "perowskit",
      "archived": false,
      "title": "JinkoSolar meldet 35,24 % TOPCon-Tandem-Weltrekord & Waseda entwickelt spannungslose helikale Perowskite",
      "source": "JinkoSolar, TaiyangNews, Waseda University & Perovskite-Info",
      "author": "JinkoSolar / SIMIT / Waseda University / MDPI",
      "date": "20. Nov 2026",
